over a country lane under a storm sky" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy"></a><a class="unrevealed-shot" href="/media/unrevealed-game/world-09.webp"><img src="/media/unrevealed-game/world-09-960.webp" alt="A chalk coastline and turquoise shallows seen from the air" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy"></a></div><div class="unrevealed-wishlist"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMING TO STEAM</p><h2>Soon to wishlist.</h2><p>Norman Ascension is still taking shape in the shadows of history. Its Steam page is in review, and wishlists open as soon as it is live.</p><p class="unrevealed-fineprint">An internet connection is required to play.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Ask to be told first <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="unrevealed-teaser-bottom"><span>AN ORIGINAL GAME BY STRATEGIC SLOTH</span><p>More to be revealed at launch.</p></div></div></section>
